    "CardName": {"ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_lq_herbal_ferment", "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HerbalFerment_CardName", "DefaultText": "Herbal Ferment"},
    "CardDescription": {"ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_lq_herbal_ferment", "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HerbalFerment_CardDescription", "DefaultText": "A sour, lightly fizzy tea fermented with honeycomb. Quenches thirst and works as a mild immune tonic for a while. It does not settle the gut."},
    "CardHelpSection": {"ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_lq_herbal_ferment", "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HerbalFerment_CardHelpSection", "DefaultText": "<b>Made from:</b> Drag a honeycomb onto a bowl of Chaga, Ginseng, Lion's Mane, Reishi or Yarrow Tea. The honeycomb is used up and the tea becomes a Young Herbal Ferment; after about three days in any container it turns into this.\n\n<b>Benefits:</b> Quenches thirst and gives a mild Herbal Tonic (an immune boost that fades over about a day). The dose is below the strong band, so it does not speed gut recovery.\n\n<b>Keeps:</b> Spoils at half the rate of an ordinary tea."},
